# Copy to your user-level ~/.npmrc or project .npmrc if IT provides a corporate root CA.
# Do NOT commit real .npmrc with secrets or company-specific paths unless your team agrees.
#
# cafile=C:/Users/you/certs/corp-root.pem
#
# If npm still fails TLS after setting NODE_OPTIONS=--use-system-ca, ask IT for the
# inspection root certificate in PEM format and uncomment cafile above.
